{"873990": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Multiverse", "steam_appid": 873990, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIVERSE: Build, Explore, Connect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your mark on a living world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Multiverse, a massive, player-driven open-world sandbox where - you, the player - can claim a kingdom and customize it as you see fit. This shared world city builder lets you shape the world your way. Design breathtaking cities, craft interactive experiences, or claim a plot of land and make it entirely your own. Every city, every forest, every lake, and every storefront creation, exists in a persistent world shared with thousands of players who are shaping their world together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across Infiniverse, a vast network of player-made cities, storefronts, and private locations. From futuristic skylines and neon metropolises to art galleries, games, and a massive planetarium. Discover something new every time you log in… or start your own adventure from scratch using intuitive tools and free templates that make building fast and fun. With over 1 million user-generated locations, Multiverse is sure to have something just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re here to create, explore, experiment with AI-powered characters, or even showcase your brand or art, Multiverse gives you total freedom. Build solo, team up with friends, or open your world to the community and watch it grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ <strong>Persistent World Building</strong> - Create spaces, skyscrapers, or whole cities that stay online and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪄 <strong>Creative Tools &amp; Templates</strong> - Start with ready-made foundations, then customize to make it yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Limitless Exploration</strong> - Visit hundreds of thousands of interconnected worlds built by players across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Player Economy</strong> - Claim land, trade properties, and grow your presence in a living, breathing economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 <strong>Thriving Community</strong> - Collaborate with builders, artists, storytellers, and explorers, shaping this ever-expanding universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The frontier is open. Claim your land. Build your dream. Join the creators shaping the Multiverse together. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Go on  - get started!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873990/extras/4337930f545cb0441e22459d0e47cec5.avif?t=1762277064\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873990/extras_big/4337930f545cb0441e22459d0e47cec5.webp?t=1762277064 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>MULTIVERSE: Build, Explore, Connect.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Leave your mark on a living world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into Multiverse, a massive, player-driven open-world sandbox where - you, the player - can claim a kingdom and customize it as you see fit. This shared world city builder lets you shape the world your way. Design breathtaking cities, craft interactive experiences, or claim a plot of land and make it entirely your own. Every city, every forest, every lake, and every storefront creation, exists in a persistent world shared with thousands of players who are shaping their world together.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Journey across Infiniverse, a vast network of player-made cities, storefronts, and private locations. From futuristic skylines and neon metropolises to art galleries, games, and a massive planetarium. Discover something new every time you log in… or start your own adventure from scratch using intuitive tools and free templates that make building fast and fun. With over 1 million user-generated locations, Multiverse is sure to have something just for you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Whether you’re here to create, explore, experiment with AI-powered characters, or even showcase your brand or art, Multiverse gives you total freedom. Build solo, team up with friends, or open your world to the community and watch it grow.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🏙️ <strong>Persistent World Building</strong> - Create spaces, skyscrapers, or whole cities that stay online and evolve.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🪄 <strong>Creative Tools &amp; Templates</strong> - Start with ready-made foundations, then customize to make it yours.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >🌍 <strong>Limitless Exploration</strong> - Visit hundreds of thousands of interconnected worlds built by players across the globe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💰 <strong>Player Economy</strong> - Claim land, trade properties, and grow your presence in a living, breathing economy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >💬 <strong>Thriving Community</strong> - Collaborate with builders, artists, storytellers, and explorers, shaping this ever-expanding universe.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>The frontier is open. Claim your land. Build your dream. Join the creators shaping the Multiverse together. </strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Go on  - get started!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873990/extras/4337930f545cb0441e22459d0e47cec5.avif?t=1762277064\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873990/extras_big/4337930f545cb0441e22459d0e47cec5.webp?t=1762277064 width=1560 height=878 /></span></p>", "short_description": "MULTIVERSE - For the People, By the People. Welcome to the future of shared gaming. An open-world experience where the terrain itself is yours to customize, build, and claim. A universe of interconnected cities, spaces, and people. Welcome to Multiverse.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873990/6ac00b499d8e53e2fb77c2d4df945f3a5678487a/header.jpg?t=1762277064", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873990/71320fd832fec05247ba7b5e70b0f7e7982c3734/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762277064", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/873990/71320fd832fec05247ba7b5e70b0f7e7982c3734/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762277064", "website": "http://www.ftl.ltd", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD R9 290 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i5-4590 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GTX 970 / AMD R9 290 equivalent or greater<br></li><li><st